# The plugin's earliest files were authored on Windows and landed with CRLF,
# while everything written since uses LF. style.css ended up mixed line by line
# (777 CRLF lines out of 2118), so any editor that rewrites the whole file
# turned a 48-line change into a 4000-line diff and buried the real edit.
#
# Pinning LF here means git normalizes on the way in regardless of who edits.
* text=auto eol=lf
